{
  "id": "1KI.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 12",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eemoojiga mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ghwasach geat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Rehoboamu ng'eanyiida Shekemu, aba gideaba buuneesean bea Israeli nupka Shekemu goombiit niny ghoah sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati ng'asheanji (abeeda gudu gwanda Misri, aba gideaba gamng'awa sugoocheanda was Sulemani), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geecheaksa eeguursa niny; ak ghwaan Yeroboamu sea fuga sean bwat geat bea Israeli ak ghapka ak gwayeesha Rehoboamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gweanu ghayi ghwanung' gwadurumaniidi yookajeagaasa. Asi ghamneawa ahaasaasa gadiyoojiga hang'oonyi bea gweanu ea yookajeagaaschi durumani aba badahuukaasa, ak gajeegadiyeeseey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Aweayeena eawooji samwagu ak goobiigu heedeanyu.” Hean gaweay buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool Rehoboamu gweargwa, abeeda miinaada aba madeeda Sulemaneeda was ghwaan damanda duu ea majeek, ak gwayeesha, “Arukunean ng'asheanda jea darukusa fiisu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa niny, “Iiwoosi siida gadiyeeda bea fiisu askweareani ak gigadiyeesi saawa, ak gibalooli ng'asheega miyaasiin damanda ishaahi ng'asheega nyaawa, abeeda saawa gayghoah fugaagu bea gadiyeeda damanda manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gafool girgweageeda rukusa gweargwa niny, ng'ata ghwaloat girgweageeda orjooga hitiisa heeda sea niny ak ghamiinaada aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Arukunean gichea darukusa fiisu eeniisean, ‘Ahaasaasa yookeeda ghayi rassa gheatkweakaasa gweanu’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha orjooga hitiisa heeda sea niny ak gwayeesha, “Eeshiina fiisu eeshiineeyiin, ‘Gweanu ghoadurumwaan yookeedeanya, asi ahaasaasa’; ak giyeeshi ang'iing'i saawa, ‘Mooneedeanyu mwanang' eahaweewa mananda bwaabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, gidaghayi iinda gheatkweakeagwa yookajeega durumani, aniini gaydeaheaneegwa gida jea ghawaas durumanata yooki. Bwaabwa ghayi ghabwaraneegwa ghealooda, ak aniini gaydabwaraneegwa udagilbajeega.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu Yeroboamu sea buuneesean heeda Rehoboamu eaweeteaba samwagu, ghoah gidarukuneata sugoocheanda nea gwayi, “Abiikni gicha heedeanyu eaweeteaba samwagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha sugoocheanda ghuusiga buuneeda aba nyarasta, nea gafool girgweageeda ghayi adaw gweargwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean goobaloola gida argweaksiinda orjooga, nea gwayeesha, “Bwaabwa ghayi ghoang'waay yookajeegeagwa, ak aniini gaydeaheaneegwa; Bwaabwa ghayi ghabwareegwa aba ghealooda, nea aniini gaydabwareegwa aba udagilbajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda ea mooleeysiina iita buuneeda; aba gideaba nih ng'asheanda leabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gayghoahiit ng'asheandaanyi, ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA aba ghuuta Ahiya was siida eemeeda Shiloni rukusa Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah buuneesean bea Israeli gideaba sugoocheanda mooleeysiina iit ng'asheega nyaawa, gwayeesha buuneeda sugoocheanda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ramooranga Shemaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahidu Rehoboamu Yerusalemu, hean ghabwada geat gealga sean bea Yuda, ea eemeeda Benjamini, fih sagalamnyooji bughala ea sis siloat bea ng'ucheeda, jea gang'uchi sea fuga Israeli, goodeelu sugoocheanduumeeda heeda Rehoboameeda was orjeeda Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu ng'asheanda ASEETA heeda Shemayeeda was siida ASEETA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rukusiina Rehoboamu orjeeda Sulemani, was sugoocheanda Yuda, ea buuneesean bea gheeh Yuda ea Benjamini, ea fuga suurja gea siipuut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, majuna ng'ucheewana fuga iduupcheewi, fuga Israeli. Adealda headiga sean gaba siisi biikta gheanyi, aba gideaba ng'asheanji gwaleabu heedeanyu.’” Hean gooleeysiit ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gabiikta ghoah gicha, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu ghwanung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadeas Yeroboamu Shekemu aba ng'eanyiida Heayeeniga bea Efraimu, ak goobiida hoowa; ng'ata ghang'eat ak ghwadeas Benueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi Yeroboamu aba jeeda gurooroadaanyi, “Ghamneawa sugoocheanduumeeda gaygabiikta gheeh Dawdi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas gaygaweay fiisu ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Yerusalemu, abeeda gurooruunatkeaba fiisu gaygabiiksa gicha heeda siida nyaawa haw, heeda Rehoboameeda was sugoocheanda Yuda, ak gaygwanuusan ak gabiikta heeda Rehoboameeda was sugoocheanda Yuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalach girgweageeda sugoocheanda, ak gwasin muhoow iyeenya bea dahaabu. Ama ng'ata gwayeesha buuneeda, “Nooweayi Yerusalemu gil geaw. Ang'ula aseecheekeagwa, Ea Israeli, aruunaneegwa ng'eanyiida Misri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin agi Beteli, ak niirja ghwayiin Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah ng'asheanji riing'eeda, aba gideaba gaweay buuneeda ghadooweeda aba hichpa siyagi aba Beteli nea geeweay heedeaba niirja aba Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin gealga aba heeda geaw, ak ghwaloat ashoohoodiga aba jeeda buuneesean mawoosa eemeeda Lawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
