          "text": "Ak Yeroboamu gwasin ghweelmeeda eaweeteaba damanamuut bea sheedeaba sis gawuurji ghweelmeeda mida ng'eanyiida Yuda, ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba heeda wagiida; ak gwasin aba Beteli, ghoadaw haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi muhooga ghayi sin. Ak ghwayiin ashoohoodiga Beteli heeda sigatgat ghayi sin. ",
